think THE ELDER PROMPT WAS THREE HOURS OLD AND THE TREE HAD MOVED UNDER IT. Since 20260917.221607 this seat reviewed the receipt contract, wrote the three open decisions up with their tradeoffs, walked the compass rose and reconciled two stale stations, folded active-designing from 215 flat to 3 with 2,703 references repointed, and corrected its own digest reading. A lap opening on the elder page would read paths that had moved.
think SO A NEW PAGE BESIDE IT RATHER THAN AN EDIT TO IT. Its basename carries a one-clock stamp, which is the mark law's own test for testimony, so it stands whole and the new one names it as superseded and links back. That is the accrete this tree defaults to.
obs THE NEW PAGE'S OWN LINK BROKE ON MY OWN FOLD, WHICH IS THE LESSON IT TEACHES ARRIVING IMMEDIATELY. I wrote two citations to the-verb-already-in-your-hand at its flat path; that page moved to active-designing/date/20260917/ three commits earlier, by my hand. The link check caught both before the commit. So the page now carries the one thing it warns about, having been bitten by it while being written.
obs THE PAGE LEADS WITH REFUSALS RATHER THAN WITH WORK, in the order they bite: the pin bound that stops every ship, readme_reach that refuses a commit breaking a living link, and the fold's own side effect of LENGTHENING every living reference into a folded room by fourteen characters. A lap meets those three before it meets anything it might want to do.
obs IT CARRIES THE CLASS THIS NIGHT MET FIVE TIMES -- a reading true about a population nobody checked -- because that is the shape of error this tree now produces, and a lap that knows it asks what population before trusting a number.
obs THE THREE PRODUCT-MEANING DECISIONS ARE NAMED WITH THEIR PAGE, including the digest proposal sharpened to exactly 64 with the scheme named SHA3-256, since 64 hex is the width of any 256-bit digest and names a family rather than an algorithm.
